This site is pretty well known among Lojbanists (at least on IRC).
I myself have contributed several Lojban decks.

That said, I appreciate your work. Personally, I have never had problems 
with the full definitions, and they are way more useful than just 
keywords. In fact, knowing a gismu without its place structure is 
relatively useless when you want to use it actively. As I cam see, 
however, you did not use mere keywords, but instead used simplified 
definitions. Looks like a good idea.
I really like the pictures.

I don't know what you mean about the permissions thing. Benjamin, the 
guy who runs memrise, has always been very helpful though, so I'm sure 
he'll get back to you soon enough.

